" class="site-search-input" data-site-search-input data-astro-cid-7yy3665x></label><!-- Results Container --><div class="results-container" data-site-search-results-container hidden data-astro-cid-7yy3665x><!-- Screen reader status --><div class="visually-hidden" role="status" aria-live="polite" data-site-search-status data-astro-cid-7yy3665x></div><!-- Error message --><div class="search-error" data-site-search-error hidden data-astro-cid-7yy3665x></div><!-- Results popover --><div class="search-popover" data-site-search-popover hidden data-astro-cid-7yy3665x><!-- Keyboard instructions --><p class="keyboard-instructions" data-site-search-keyboard-instructions aria-hidden="true" data-astro-cid-7yy3665x><kbd data-astro-cid-7yy3665x>tab</kbd> to navigate, <kbd data-astro-cid-7yy3665x>enter</kbd> to select, <kbd data-astro-cid-7yy3665x>esc</kbd> to dismiss</p><!-- Results list --><ol class="search-results-list" data-site-search-results data-astro-cid-7yy3665x></ol><!-- No results message --><div class="no-results" data-site-search-no-results hidden data-astro-cid-7yy3665x><p data-astro-cid-7yy3665x><span class="no-results-label" data-astro-cid-7yy3665x>No results found for: <span class="site-search-query-display" data-site-search-query-display data-astro-cid-7yy3665x></span></span><span class="no-results-suggestion" data-astro-cid-7yy3665x>Try <a class="link-default " href="https://search.lib.umich.edu/everything?utm_source=lib-site-search" data-astro-cid-7yy3665x="true">Library Search</a> for books, articles, and more.</span></p></div></div></div></form><!-- HTML Templates --><template data-library-search-template data-astro-cid-7yy3665x><li class="search-result-item" data-astro-cid-7yy3665x><a class="library-search-option" target="_blank" rel="noopener" data-astro-cid-7yy3665x><svg width="24px" height="24px" viewBox="0 0 24 24" class="library-search-icon" aria-hidden="true" style="display: inline-block; fill: currentColor; vertical-align: middle; "><path d="M15.5 14h